# --- Report/presentation exceptions (isles26_project only) ---
# The report-worthy figures and summary tables above get blanket-ignored by
# the "Generated outputs" rules (figures/, results.csv, etc.) along with the
# scratch/debug output they're meant to catch. Un-ignore just these specific,
# curated paths so they stay in the repo (and visible to Claude via the
# GitHub connector) for the presentation/report. Everything else under
# workspace/ (predictions, raw NIfTI, final_holdout/, archive/) stays hidden.
!isles26_project/workspace/figures/
!isles26_project/workspace/figures/**
!isles26_project/workspace/sample_run/figures/
!isles26_project/workspace/sample_run/figures/**
!isles26_project/workspace/results/results.csv
!isles26_project/workspace/results/summary_by_experiment.csv
!isles26_project/workspace/results/summary_by_size_bin.csv
!isles26_project/workspace/sample_run/case_metadata.csv
!isles26_project/workspace/sample_run/evaluation/results.csv
!isles26_project/workspace/sample_run/evaluation/summary_by_experiment.csv
!isles26_project/workspace/sample_run/evaluation/summary_by_size_bin.csv

